    <briefdescription>
<para>Helper for printing DanglingDebugInfo. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This hoop-jumping is to store a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_value" kindref="compound">Value</ref> pointer, so that we can print a whole DDI as one object. Call SelectionDAGBuilder::printDDI instead of using directly. </para>
